{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "initialState: test file -> launches and their payloads, or errors",
  "description": [
    "Shared vector for building the JSONUI_TEST_INITIAL_STATE payload (spec section 10.2). Run by the three drivers and by `jsonui-test validate`.",
    "test is the file as written; files holds the screen test files a flow references, by the path the flow writes.",
    "expect.launches: the launches the driver makes, in order. before is 'file' (once, before the first case) or 'case:<name>' (reopen, before that case). screens is the payload's screens object, or null when that launch carries no payload. A launch that carries a payload also carries version 1 and a fresh launchId; neither is compared here.",
    "expect.caseFailures: cases the driver fails without running their steps, with failureReason and a code. expect.warnings: driver warnings by code. expect.validateErrors: errors `jsonui-test validate` reports, by code. A driver reads only launches / caseFailures / warnings; the CLI reads only validateErrors and warnings.",
    "Codes are the contract; each implementation writes its own message from the code. Field order inside screens is not compared.",
    "Drivers do not judge values: an unknown key, a null or a mistyped value travels in the payload and is rejected by the app (initial-state-coercion.json)."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "screen id is the layout basename, verbatim (no case change)",
      "test": {
        "type": "screen",
        "source": {
          "layout": "Layouts/ProductDetail.json"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "name": "t"
        },
        "initialState": {
          "viewModel": {
            "title": "x"
          }
        },
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "a",
            "steps": [
              {
                "assert": "visible",
                "id": "title_label"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "launches": [
          {
            "before": "file",
            "screens": {
              "ProductDetail": {
                "title": "x"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "caseFailures": [],
        "warnings": [],
        "validateErrors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a size-class variant normalizes to its base id; directories do not count",
      "test": {
        "type": "screen",
        "source": {
          "layout": "Layouts/settings/notification_settings@regular.json"
        },
        "metadata": {
          "name": "t"
        },
        "initialState": {
          "viewModel": {
            "enabled": true
          }
        },
        "cases": [
          {
            "name": "a",
            "steps": [
              {
                "assert": "visible",
                "id": "title_label"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "launches": [
          {
            "before": "file",
            "screens": {
              "notification_settings": {
                "enabled": true
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "caseFailures": [],
        "warnings": [],
        "validateErrors": []
      }
    },
